            "content": "<h2><strong>Elephant translocation</strong></h2>\n<p><strong>Reasons for overpopulation at Majete National Park</strong></p>\n<p>●&nbsp;&nbsp; strict enforcement of anti-poaching laws</p>\n<p>●&nbsp;&nbsp; successful breeding</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Problems caused by elephant overpopulation</strong></p>\n<p>●&nbsp;&nbsp; greater competition, causing hunger for elephants</p>\n<p>●&nbsp;&nbsp; damage to <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_31\">______</span> in the park</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>The translocation process</strong></p>\n<p>●&nbsp;&nbsp; a suitable group of elephants from the same <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_32\">______</span> was selected</p>\n<p>●&nbsp;&nbsp; vets and park staff made use of <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_33\">______</span> to help guide the elephants into an open plain</p>\n<p>●&nbsp;&nbsp; elephants were immobilised with tranquilisers</p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &ndash;&nbsp; &nbsp;this process had to be completed quickly to reduce <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_34\">______</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &ndash; &nbsp;&nbsp;elephants had to be turned on their <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_35\">______</span> to avoid damage to their lungs</p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &ndash; &nbsp;&nbsp;elephants&rsquo; <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_36\">______</span> had to be monitored constantly</p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &ndash; &nbsp;&nbsp;tracking devices were fitted to the matriarchs</p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &ndash; &nbsp;&nbsp;data including the size of their tusks and <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_37\">______</span> was taken</p>\n<p>●&nbsp;&nbsp; elephants were taken by truck to their new reserve</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Advantages of translocation at Nkhotakota Wildlife Park</strong></p>\n<p>●&nbsp; &nbsp;<span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_38\">______</span> opportunities</p>\n<p>●&nbsp;&nbsp; a reduction in the number of poachers and <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_39\">______</span></p>\n<p>●&nbsp;&nbsp; an example of conservation that other parks can follow</p>\n<p>●&nbsp;&nbsp; an increase in <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_40\">______</span> as a contributor to GDP</p>",
